      "machineText": "我们还将重新启用 [Wails subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/)，并在 v3 迈向正式发布的过程中积极维护它，使其成为另一个开展实践讨论、提出问题和提供反馈的平台。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "We are also relaunching the [Wails subreddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/wails/)\\ and will actively ma…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
